'''Splunk Searches saved and documented for convenience'''



'''Search that proves the distributed connection is working. Identifies inputting hostnames.'''
index="endpoint_windows" | stats count by host

'''Shows the distribution between Security, System, and Application logs. Security was the loudest.'''
index="endpoint_windows" | stats count by source

'''Displays what codes are coming through, windows in this case.'''
index="endpoint_windows" | stats count by EventCode | sort - count